msgid "Creation"
msgstr "창조"

#. Key:	D3DA682949B946E5980215BBE6B17982
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Darkness.DA_Pandora_Darkness.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Darkness.DA_Pandora_Darkness.Description
msgctxt ",D3DA682949B946E5980215BBE6B17982"
msgid "A quiet Pandora that drifted through ruined cities where even light feared to remain."
msgstr "빛조차 머무르기를 두려워한 폐허의 도시들을 떠돌던 고요한 판도라입니다."

#. Key:	D420840241BE9214F851CABA6FF6AEAD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Darkness.DA_Pandora_Darkness.DisplayName
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Darkness.DA_Pandora_Darkness.DisplayName
msgctxt ",D420840241BE9214F851CABA6FF6AEAD"
msgid "Darkness"
msgstr "어둠"

#. Key:	3EBE98EE4924A38BA9E56297A8E2056B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Death.DA_Pandora_Death.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Death.DA_Pandora_Death.Description
msgctxt ",3EBE98EE4924A38BA9E56297A8E2056B"
msgid "A silent Pandora left in the wake of Death, cold to the fearful and strangely peaceful to the resigned."
msgstr "죽음이 지나간 자리에 남은 침묵의 판도라. 두려워하는 이에게는 차갑지만, 받아들인 이에게는 기묘한 평온을 줍니다."

#. Key:	81A699C34F12A644D1B0698C527F3588
