#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Death.DA_Pandora_Death.DisplayName
msgctxt ",81A699C34F12A644D1B0698C527F3588"
msgid "Death"
msgstr "죽음"

#. Key:	B37AECE14F780B3F702918BC30D4CE41
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Demon.DA_Pandora_Demon.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Demon.DA_Pandora_Demon.Description
msgctxt ",B37AECE14F780B3F702918BC30D4CE41"
msgid "A remnant of Baal’s fallen dominion, not merely wicked, but proud, defiant, and unwilling to kneel before gods or men."
msgstr "바알의 몰락한 지배가 남긴 흔적. 단순히 사악한 것이 아니라, 신과 인간 어느 쪽에도 무릎 꿇지 않는 오만함과 반항을 품고 있습니다."

#. Key:	134229BD4997C12ACD64B19218E78D6D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Demon.DA_Pandora_Demon.DisplayName
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Demon.DA_Pandora_Demon.DisplayName
msgctxt ",134229BD4997C12ACD64B19218E78D6D"
msgid "Demon"
msgstr "악마"

#. Key:	97B9870140CDCE23AAF5DCBBF2EDF896
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Dimension.DA_Pandora_Dimension.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Dimension.DA_Pandora_Dimension.Description
msgctxt ",97B9870140CDCE23AAF5DCBBF2EDF896"
msgid "A fractured Pandora left behind when Divine escaped beyond the world, still trembling with the memory of another reality."
msgstr "디바인이 세계 너머로 탈출하며 남긴 부서진 판도라. 다른 현실의 기억으로 아직도 떨리고 있습니다."

#. Key:	33E88A4C4EE4C30C767171AA7BAAB910
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Dimension.DA_Pandora_Dimension.DisplayName
