msgctxt ",33E88A4C4EE4C30C767171AA7BAAB910"
msgid "Dimension"
msgstr "차원"

#. Key:	8791EE22464189EC1809B8B3CD56F1EF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Distortion.DA_Pandora_Distortion.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Distortion.DA_Pandora_Distortion.Description
msgctxt ",8791EE22464189EC1809B8B3CD56F1EF"
msgid "A warped Pandora born where broken dimensions and unstable memories collapsed into one another."
msgstr "부서진 차원과 불안정한 기억이 서로 무너져 겹친 곳에서 태어난 뒤틀린 판도라입니다."

#. Key:	70C9E00147E0095E9DC8FDA7D7055582
