msgctxt ",70C9E00147E0095E9DC8FDA7D7055582"
msgid "Distortion"
msgstr "왜곡"

#. Key:	D644D2034F75FEEA918A269E6146521F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Doll.DA_Pandora_Doll.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Doll.DA_Pandora_Doll.Description
msgctxt ",D644D2034F75FEEA918A269E6146521F"
msgid "A lonely Pandora said to have formed around a forgotten doll that waited centuries for someone to return."
msgstr "누군가 돌아오기를 수백 년간 기다린 잊힌 인형 곁에서 생겨났다고 전해지는 외로운 판도라입니다."

#. Key:	88F9C39349400E6B337756AC3DBBB21F
