msgid "Doll"
msgstr "인형"

#. Key:	8634999842C607A86A0A0E82418BCF06
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Doom.DA_Pandora_Doom.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Doom.DA_Pandora_Doom.Description
msgctxt ",8634999842C607A86A0A0E82418BCF06"
msgid "A heavy Pandora stained by Calyps’ calamity, remembered in villages that vanished before they could write their final records."
msgstr "칼립스의 재앙에 물든 무거운 판도라. 마지막 기록조차 남기지 못하고 사라진 마을들의 기억을 품고 있습니다."

#. Key:	C2D892C941154F519FFCF99905246D4E
