msgctxt ",C2D892C941154F519FFCF99905246D4E"
msgid "Doom"
msgstr "파멸"

#. Key:	1B22566042F329EAC407F8B482F52244
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Duplication.DA_Pandora_Duplication.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Duplication.DA_Pandora_Duplication.Description
msgctxt ",1B22566042F329EAC407F8B482F52244"
msgid "A mirror-like Pandora shaped by those who wished to escape themselves, only to meet another self in the dark."
msgstr "자기 자신에게서 벗어나려다 어둠 속에서 또 다른 자신을 마주한 이들이 빚어낸 거울 같은 판도라입니다."

