msgid "Hand"
msgstr "손"

#. Key:	47E6AFD14D764C586AF18AB16AB56F6B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_HolyKnight.DA_Pandora_HolyKnight.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_HolyKnight.DA_Pandora_HolyKnight.Description
msgctxt ",47E6AFD14D764C586AF18AB16AB56F6B"
msgid "A noble Pandora born from the vows of an old knight order that served heaven even after the gods fell."
msgstr "신들이 몰락한 뒤에도 하늘을 섬긴 오래된 기사단의 맹세에서 태어난 고귀한 판도라입니다."

#. Key:	D882162544B03147E87FE08500C1C52B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_HolyKnight.DA_Pandora_HolyKnight.DisplayName
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_HolyKnight.DA_Pandora_HolyKnight.DisplayName
msgctxt ",D882162544B03147E87FE08500C1C52B"
msgid "Holy Knight"
msgstr "성기사"

#. Key:	4E8EDFF5429880686C1052B4F48FD130
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Light.DA_Pandora_Light.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Light.DA_Pandora_Light.Description
msgctxt ",4E8EDFF5429880686C1052B4F48FD130"
msgid "A bright Pandora carrying the trace of Rat’s light and Michael’s fading grace, most vivid to those who survived the dark."
msgstr "라트의 빛과 희미해지는 미카엘의 은총을 품은 밝은 판도라. 어둠을 살아남은 이에게 가장 선명하게 빛납니다."

#. Key:	6B77A62F4875FE56B62A0FB82BE1E160
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Light.DA_Pandora_Light.DisplayName
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Light.DA_Pandora_Light.DisplayName
msgctxt ",6B77A62F4875FE56B62A0FB82BE1E160"
msgid "Light"
msgstr "빛"

#. Key:	497DAA944AFE84728C3FEE837982A21B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Lightning.DA_Pandora_Lightning.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Lightning.DA_Pandora_Lightning.Description
msgctxt ",497DAA944AFE84728C3FEE837982A21B"
msgid "A restless Pandora left by Rani, striking the heart like a memory that arrives one moment too soon."
msgstr "라니가 남긴 쉼 없는 판도라. 한순간 일찍 찾아온 기억처럼 심장을 꿰뚫습니다."

#. Key:	28C7AD37470F23B1300F1BADA5E112F6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Lightning.DA_Pandora_Lightning.DisplayName
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Lightning.DA_Pandora_Lightning.DisplayName
msgctxt ",28C7AD37470F23B1300F1BADA5E112F6"
msgid "Lightning"
msgstr "번개"

#. Key:	305C43B942A89D697442D682AA91D9AB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Machine.DA_Pandora_Machine.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Machine.DA_Pandora_Machine.Description
msgctxt ",305C43B942A89D697442D682AA91D9AB"
msgid "A mechanical Pandora created from Erad’s forbidden research, cold in shape yet strangely close to a living pulse."
msgstr "에라드의 금지된 연구로 만들어진 기계 판도라. 차가운 형체 속에 기이하게도 살아 있는 듯한 맥박이 느껴집니다."

#. Key:	EBE0437A47D9F6E39D0CF08D42F31C2C
