msgid "Machine"
msgstr "기계"

#. Key:	DE9701254525F0734320D8996453FF92
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Nature.DA_Pandora_Nature.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Nature.DA_Pandora_Nature.Description
msgctxt ",DE9701254525F0734320D8996453FF92"
msgid "A gentle Pandora born from Monia’s earth and Kata’s first forests, carrying the scent of soil after rain."
msgstr "모니아의 대지와 카타의 첫 숲에서 태어난 온화한 판도라. 비 온 뒤 흙내음을 간직하고 있습니다."

#. Key:	28A6C45C4C5B678F8B9BC785C681B027
