msgid "Nature"
msgstr "자연"

#. Key:	C8F466C9401C94C03A4B60955B39CA53
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_NineTailedFox.DA_Pandora_NineTailedFox.Description
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_NineTailedFox.DA_Pandora_NineTailedFox.Description
msgctxt ",C8F466C9401C94C03A4B60955B39CA53"
msgid "A cunning Pandora from the eastern shrine ruins, wrapped in old rumors, false smiles, and beautiful lies."
msgstr "동방 신전의 폐허에서 온 교활한 판도라. 오래된 소문과 거짓 미소, 아름다운 거짓말에 싸여 있습니다."

#. Key:	300AB0004B12F1B8CFEBC79EBFD88F63
